  dialogue:
  - Dialogue: "I\u2019ve been watching the news lately."
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 599283ca56aa9da4f85f3d7e2e07d0a4, type: 3}
  - Dialogue: Lot of scary stuff out there
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - Dialogue: ...
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - Dialogue: Have you seen all that stuff about the aliens?
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
  Charming_Expression:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "That\u2019s awesome, you guys must be really close. You guys will
        definitely make it to the other side if it all hits the fan."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cd8144ceafb8c9d4f95961ab12e9d3e5, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: Yeah, all my friends at school have been talking about it recently.
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 15
  Assertive_Expression:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "Oh that\u2019s alright, just thought it might have been something
        you and your friends might have been talking about."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cd8144ceafb8c9d4f95961ab12e9d3e5, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "No, I don\u2019t really watch that kind of stuff."
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 5
  Sappy_Expression:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "Sorry kiddo, I didn\u2019t mean to scare you. You are going to be
        just fine trust me. All that stuff isn\u2019t real anyways."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cd8144ceafb8c9d4f95961ab12e9d3e5, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "Oh yeah, scary stuff, I\u2019ve been sleeping in Mom\u2019s
      room for that past few nights."
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: -5
  Charming_Observation:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "That\u2019s awesome, you guys must be really close. You guys will
        definitely make it to the other side if it all hits the fan."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cd8144ceafb8c9d4f95961ab12e9d3e5, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: Yeah, my friends and I have been preparing the fort in the back
      with food and defenses.
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 15
  Assertive_Observation:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: Oh yeah, real crazy people nowadays. They might even be scarier than
        the aliens they talk about all the time.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cd8144ceafb8c9d4f95961ab12e9d3e5, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "I saw some parts of it, I can\u2019t understand how people actually
      believe in all that stuff."
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: -10
  Sappy_Observation:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "Oh that\u2019s alright, just thought it might have been something
        you and your friends might have been talking about."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cd8144ceafb8c9d4f95961ab12e9d3e5, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "I haven\u2019t really had the time to watch the news, been way
      to busy with school."
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 5
  Charming_Question:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "Of course. I\u2019ve even got a fort in my backyard packed with
        food and defenses that will last me at least a decade if the worst comes."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cd8144ceafb8c9d4f95961ab12e9d3e5, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: Do you believe that stuff too?
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 10
  Assertive_Question:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: Oh no, I was just kidding, just thought it was really funny when
        I saw it the other day, your Little Cousin and I could not stop laughing.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cd8144ceafb8c9d4f95961ab12e9d3e5, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: Do you really believe all that stuff?
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: -15
  Sappy_Question:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: Oh no, I was just kidding, just thought it was really funny when
        I saw it the other day, your Little Cousin and I could not stop laughing.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cd8144ceafb8c9d4f95961ab12e9d3e5, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "I haven\u2019t been able to sleep a wink the past few nights.
      Do you really think they will come and get me?"
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: -5
